Ready --> Processing_Request : Receive Suggestion Request
Processing_Request --> Gathering_Videos : User Identified

Gathering_Videos --> Enriching_Data : All Video Sources Processed

Enriching_Data --> Suggestions_Sent : Send Suggestions
Suggestions_Sent --> [*] : Return to Ready

